    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "42 Glenville Avenue, Clonsilla, Dublin 15 Asking Price: €620,000 Exceptional 4-Bedroom Semi-Detached Family Home with Garage & Substantial Workshop Description Lloyd Daly & Associates are proud to introduce to the market this outstanding 4-bedroom semi-detached residence, superbly positioned on the highly regarded Glenville Avenue in Clonsilla. Rarely does a home of this calibre, combining elegant living spaces, extensive outbuildings, and mature landscaped gardens, become available in such a prime Dublin 15 location. The property is beautifully set back from the road, facing a large green, with a cobblelock driveway offering parking for up to four cars. An attractive aluminium storm porch with tiled flooring leads into a warm and welcoming hallway with wooden floors, setting the tone for the accommodation beyond. Internally, the property boasts generous proportions and a superb layout ideally suited to modern family living. The spacious sitting room (12.3 x 29.2) is a particular highlight, featuring a charming brick open fireplace and wooden flooring. The contemporary fitted kitchen (14.2 x 9.2), complete with built-in units and tiled flooring, flows naturally into the bright breakfast room (13.5 x 12.1), creating a wonderful everyday living and dining space. A downstairs WC and garage (11.1 x 10.1), wired for electrics, complete the ground floor. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms – three doubles and one single – all finished with either laminate or carpet flooring, with two bedrooms benefitting from built-in wardrobes. The master bathroom (5.5 x 7.5) is fully tiled and fitted with an electric T90 shower, wash hand basin, and WC. Externally, the property truly excels. The rear garden is a private sanctuary, beautifully landscaped with mature trees, shrubs, and Indian sandstone paving. To the rear lies an exceptional addition – a substantial workshop with a main work area (36.1 x 22.2) and a separate office (10.1 x 7.1). This versatile space is ideal for those seeking a home business premises, hobby space, or significant storage capacity. Additional features include triple-glazed aluminium windows, gas-fired central heating, and an overall floor area extending to approx. 1,410 sq. ft. This fine home offers both comfort and flexibility, ensuring it will appeal to families and  alike. Key Features • Impressive 4-bedroom semi-detached residence in prime Clonsilla location • Spacious accommodation extending to c. 1,410 sq. ft. • Bright sitting room with feature brick fireplace and wooden flooring • Modern fitted kitchen and adjoining breakfast room • Garage to the side with excellent conversion potential (SPP) • Substantial workshop with office – ideal for home business, hobbies, or storage • Mature landscaped rear garden with Indian sandstone patio • Cobblelock driveway with parking for up to 4 cars • Triple-glazed aluminium windows & gas-fired central heating • Facing a large green in a quiet residential setting • Excellent transport links including Clonsilla Train Station, N3 & M50 • Close to Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, schools, and all local amenities Please Call : 01-820-8333 or Email:@LloydDalys@Gmail.com"
      },
